	(text "P5  SPARE"(exclude_from_sim no)(at 25.40 256.54 0)(effects(font(size 1.524 1.524))(justify left top))(uuid "01ee2446-47b7-4d6c-a5a0-2538efa6a11a"))
	(text "SENSOR SUPPLIES"(exclude_from_sim no)(at 317.50 22.86 0)(effects(font(size 2.0 2.0))(justify left top))(uuid "4988ecdb-3598-4e5c-96f0-05cc79b2810f"))
	(text "JUMPER SETTINGS (each channel)\n PWR  : 1-2 = 5V sensor (DEFAULT)   2-3 = 12V sensor\n 4-20mA: fit for current-loop sensors (adds 150R)\n 0-10V : fit for 0-10V output sensors\nDefault (no 4-20mA, no 0-10V, PWR 1-2) suits 0.5-4.5V / 0-5V / 1-5V sensors.\nWARNING: never set PWR to 12V for a 5V sensor - it will destroy it.\nADC: P1-P3 -> ADS1115 #1 (0x48) AIN1-3,  P4/P5 -> ADS1115 #3 (0x4B) AIN1/2,\n     SENS_5V monitor -> ADS1115 #3 AIN3 (ratiometric correction).\nUnplugged sensor reads 0V (divider pulls down) -> firmware shows 'sensor disconnected'.\nFirmware: 2-point calibration per channel (zero + known gauge pressure)."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 317.50 129.54 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "bb6df12c-ab3c-4540-b687-9df37352ee71"))
	(text "2. IO EXPANDER #2  MCP23017 at 0x21 (A0 high)"(exclude_from_sim no)(at 25.40 325.12 0)(effects(font(size 2.0 2.0))(justify left top))(uuid "1a4d1cb8-7dae-42b8-a32a-63a20f619945"))
	(text "GPA0 = RLY11 (valve 9), GPA1 = RLY12 (valve 10) via ribbon pins 21/22.\nOther 14 lines on J43 for opto inputs / future use (3.3V logic only)."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 25.40 411.48 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "7a65f4fa-1af5-4759-8cda-20678ed1ae5e"))
	(text "3. KEYPAD  8-pin membrane (4x4 matrix) -> MCP23017 #1 GPA0-7"(exclude_from_sim no)(at 254.00 325.12 0)(effects(font(size 2.0 2.0))(justify left top))(uuid "b994cf3c-12c1-4193-a358-fbe2b70036a4"))
	(text "Firmware 'Keypad setup' learns which pin pair is each key - no manual mapping needed."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 254.00 396.24 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "bc91184f-a993-496d-8488-aa975febacdf"))
	(text "4. RGB STATUS LED  (WS2812B on IO48)"(exclude_from_sim no)(at 254.00 275.90 0)(effects(font(size 2.0 2.0))(justify left top))(uuid "ab49dff0-96de-4610-a85a-6b4507d7b205"))
